  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "By using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/967b6e9928672e977abcd16f2efd8970801b9d6413d30ba7cdd0b9d8fef645f4.png] \n\n1) + and ÷\n\nGiven equation is : 5 - 24 + 17 × 16 ÷ 4 = 133\n\nAfter interchanging the signs the equation formed is as follows : \n\n⇒ 5 - __**24 ÷ 17**__ × 16 + 4 = 133\n\n⇒ 5 - __**1.4117 × 16**__ + 4 = 133\n\n⇒ __**5**__ - 22.588 __**+ 4**__ = 133\n\n⇒ __**9**____** - 22.588 **__= 133\n\n⇒ - 13.588 ≠ 133\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**2) × and -**\n\n**Given equation is : 5 - 24 + 17 × 16 ÷ 4 = 133**\n\n**After interchanging the signs the equation formed is as follows : **\n\n⇒ 5 × 24 + 17 - __**16 ÷ 4**__ = 133\n\n⇒ __**5 × 24**__ + 17 - 4 = 133\n\n⇒ **__120 + 17__** - 4 = 133\n\n⇒ **__137 - 4__** = 133\n\n**⇒ 133 = 133**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n3) × and ÷\n\nGiven equation is : 5 - 24 + 17 × 16 ÷ 4 = 133\n\nAfter interchanging the signs the equation formed is as follows : \n\n⇒ 5 - 24 + **__17 ÷ 16__** × 4 = 133\n\n⇒ 5 - 24 + **__1.0625 × 4__** = 133\n\n⇒ **__5 __**- 24 **__+ 4.25__** = 133\n\n⇒ **__9.25__****__ - 24__** = 133\n\n⇒ - 14.75 ≠ 133\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) + and ×\n\nGiven equation is : 5 - 24 + 17 × 16 ÷ 4 = 133\n\nAfter interchanging the signs the equation formed is as follows : \n\n⇒ 5 - 24 × 17 + __**16 ÷ 4**__ = 133\n\n⇒ 5 - **__24 × 17__** + 4 = 133\n\n⇒ **__5__** - 408 __**+ 4**__ = 133\n\n⇒ __**9**____** - 408**__ = 133\n\n⇒ - 399 ≠ 133\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is** Option 2:** **\"****× and -\".**",
